From e9b00293eb47a3f7bee241dbdf60beb7745ccd28 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hangtian Zhu <hangtian@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Mar 2026 19:02:25 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] cfg80211w: CFG80211_PROP_MULTI_LINK_SUPPORT changes for
 kernel 6.6

Add CFG80211_PROP_MULTI_LINK_SUPPORT changes for kernel 6.6, to adapt
Waikiki MLO driver implementations on msm-6.6 kernel.

Changes copied from:
https://git.codelinaro.org/clo/qsdk/oss/kernel/linux-ipq-6.6/-/tree/eb2daa12ed16878aaede529731312bce40358da8

Signed-off-by: Hangtian Zhu <hangtian@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
